#. Description of the plugin
#: imagecraft-ai-alt-text-file-renamer-image-seo.php
msgid "All-in-one image toolkit: AI alt text, titles & descriptions, local image compression, WebP conversion, image fallbacks, SEO file renaming, and an image SEO audit. Works with the WordPress 7.0 native AI Client, Anthropic, OpenAI and Gemini — compression and WebP need no API key."
